        "tokenLemmas": "{\"6\":{\"lemma\":\"おっしゃる\",\"morphs\":[{\"surface\":\"おっしゃい\",\"lemma\":\"おっしゃる\",\"reading\":\"オッシャイ\",\"pos\":\"動詞\",\"detail\":\"自立\",\"conjugatedType\":\"五段・ラ行特殊\",\"conjugatedForm\":\"連用形\"},{\"surface\":\"まし\",\"lemma\":\"ます\",\"reading\":\"マシ\",\"pos\":\"助動詞\",\"detail\":\"*\",\"conjugatedType\":\"特殊・マス\",\"conjugatedForm\":\"連用形\"},{\"surface\":\"た\",\"lemma\":\"た\",\"reading\":\"タ\",\"pos\":\"助動詞\",\"detail\":\"*\",\"conjugatedType\":\"特殊・タ\",\"conjugatedForm\":\"基本形\"}]}}",
